        "ergo-state/src/reader.rs:183",
        "ergo-indexer/src/task.rs:334",
        "ergo-sync/src/executor/block_apply.rs:175"
      ],
      "cause": "Captured applied tip height limits a forward traversal of HEADER_CHAIN_INDEX, while tip membership is checked only in rollback divergence branch. An index tip below the fork point can follow an unapplied competing branch. Section presence is not full-block validation.",
